\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Verification of the SC-ODT implementation under plane strain, eddy events suppressed and zero molecular diffusion. (\textit  {a}) Component energy fractions; (\textit  {b}) kinetic-energy amplification $k_t(e)/k_t(0)$. Open symbols: the SC-ODT line solver (length-weighted line averages), by component ($\circ \,\overline  {u_1^2}$, $\square \,\overline  {u_2^2}$, $\triangle \,\overline  {u_3^2}$); dashed: the LRR closure integrated as a moment equation; solid with filled symbols: exact rapid-distortion theory. The solver reproduces the closure to $10^{-4}$ in the fractions and $0.3\%$ in the energy; the offset from the exact solution is the closure error of \S  \,\ref {sec:finite-strain}, as it must be.}}{15}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
